Sun Nov 15 12:30:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Build with CGO_ENABLED=1 (BuildRequires gcc): CGO_ENABLED=0 with
  -buildmode=pie produced static-pie binaries (rpmlint
  statically-linked-binary); now linked against glibc

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Nov 15 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of yggdrasil-go 0.5.15 for openSUSE Leap 16.0
  * Own spec; Go modules vendored from the v0.5.15 tag (vendor.tar.zst)
  * Upstream systemd units: yggdrasil.service plus
    yggdrasil-default-config.service, which generates /etc/yggdrasil.conf
    on first start; the service is not enabled by default
  * yggdrasil group via sysusers.d; members can use yggdrasilctl
    (admin socket /run/yggdrasil.sock is 0660 root:yggdrasil)
  * 0.5.15: routing fixes (stale ancestry, looping parents, bloom filter
    cleanup), QUIC/WebSocket SNI and timeout fixes, admin socket limits
